          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Histopathologic examination— pyogranulomatous or granulomatous cellulitis with colonies of filamentous bacteria; special stains may enhance visualization. Sulfur granules are a useful diagnostic tool, but can be difficult to find.",
